// Configuration and Policy (BC-5) internal interface.
//
// The control plane is the PUBLISHED-LANGUAGE SUPPLIER here and the data plane is its
// customer. The supplier may not break the customer's contract without a new major
// event version.
//
// The data plane never takes a synchronous dependency on this service for a payment. It
// warms a local snapshot from `configuration.published.v1`, tolerates 30 s of
// staleness, and FAILS STATIC: if the control plane is entirely down it keeps
// processing with its last-known-good snapshot rather than either stopping (which kills
// revenue) or ignoring limits (which kills compliance). Past max_config_staleness
// (15 min) it fails closed for NEW merchants while continuing to serve existing ones.
